            "kind": "production",
            "response": "written",
            "prompt": "Write a brief update about the familiar trip for someone who was absent. Preserve who went and whether the event occurred.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "A friend was absent from a travel conversation. You have travelled before; the other person has not. No destination or date was given. Write an update preserving whose experience is positive and whose is negative.\nFamiliar meanings available: before; formerly; travel; go on a trip; not; have not.",
            "contextLanguage": "en",
            "label": "Write your own message",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed writing practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My account preserves participants and event status."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "Its sequence or reason is clear without an unexplained jump."
              }
